@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 飞机大战排行榜 DAO 模式（Data Access Object Pattern）

class Main <<窗口协调>>
class RankingFrame <<排行榜界面>>
class RankingService <<业务服务>> {
  - dao: ScoreDao
  + ranking(): List<ScoreRecord>
  + save(name: String, score: int, endedAt: LocalDateTime): void
  + delete(record: ScoreRecord): boolean
}

interface ScoreDao <<DAO 接口>> {
    + findAll(): List<ScoreRecord>
    + save(record: ScoreRecord): void
    + delete(record: ScoreRecord): boolean
}

class FileScoreDao <<DAO 实现>> {
    - filePath: Path
    + FileScoreDao(filePath: Path)
    + findAll(): List<ScoreRecord>
    + save(record: ScoreRecord): void
    + delete(record: ScoreRecord): boolean
}

class ScoreRecord <<数据对象>> {
    - playerName: String
    - score: int
    - recordedAt: LocalDateTime
    + getPlayerName(): String
    + getScore(): int
    + getRecordedAt(): LocalDateTime
}

Main ..> FileScoreDao : 根据难度配置文件
Main ..> RankingFrame : 游戏结束时显示
RankingFrame --> RankingService
RankingService --> ScoreDao : 保存、排序和删除成绩
ScoreDao <|.. FileScoreDao
ScoreDao ..> ScoreRecord : 操作
FileScoreDao ..> ScoreRecord : 文件读写

note right of FileScoreDao
  每个难度传入不同文件路径
  如 scores/normal.tsv
end note

@enduml
